  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Medel f&#xf6;r utv&#xe4;rderingar och metodfr&#xe5;gor 2012</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Medel f&#xf6;r utv&#xe4;rderingar och metodfr&#xe5;gor 2012</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Mindre insatser s&#xe5;som st&#xf6;d till konferenser, studier, s&#xe4;rskilda rapporter, workshops o dyl. bokf&#xf6;rs under denna insats. Dessutom avrop under v&#xe5;ra ramavtal med revisionsbyr&#xe5;er bokf&#xf6;rs h&#xe4;r. Denna insats fungerar som en &quot;strategisk fond&quot;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Smaller amounts of support for such activities as conferences, studies, special reports and workshops are to recorded under this contribution. Also, call-off orders made within our framework agreements with audit firms are charged to this contribution. It works as a &quot;strategic fund&quot;.</narrative>
  </description>
